# Presence rendering

Draw Divine Spark once, from the console shell, with canvas 2D. Keep one conversation and one microphone. Do not draw the human glTF as the presence. Do not add a second speech engine on a page.

- The microphone stays off until the operator turns it on.
- A Spanish reply is spoken only when a female Spanish voice is selected. Otherwise leave the line on screen.
- High, medium, and low tiers change the filament count. A measured frame rate below 24 selects low.
- Label simulated homes as simulation.

Do not add a neon bloom pass. Do not describe Piper or a Mexican accent as present unless a listened test recorded that voice.
